# Internal libraries (in-repo)

## When to extract

| Signal | Target |
|--------|--------|
| Same UI markup 2+ times | `shared/ui/<name>.ui.tsx` |
| Same pure logic 2+ times | `shared/lib/<name>.lib.ts` |
| Same page lifecycle 2+ times | `shared/lib/*.hook.ts` |
| File > 300 lines or cognitive complexity > 25 | Split by responsibility |

## Forms

- **Const object API** — `guard`, `env` pattern for stateless utilities
- **Named functions** — `datetime.lib.ts`, `request-lifecycle.lib.ts`
- **React hooks** — `use-cache-first-page.hook.ts`, feature `*.hook.ts`
- **UI primitives** — Radix wrappers (`app-dialog`, `folder-form-modal`)

## Rules

- No barrel `index.ts` re-exports — import concrete files
- `shared/` must not import from `features/` or `widgets/`
- New cross-cutting pattern → ADR in `docs/adr/`
- Prefer explicit names (`formatMessageTimeShort` vs overloaded `formatMessageTime`)

## Dialogs

Use `AppDialog` + `AppDialogFormFooter` from `~/shared/ui/app-dialog.ui` for new modals.

## Cache-first lists

Use `useCacheFirstPageLoad` + `request-lifecycle.lib` for feed/inbox/activity-style pages.
